    <!-- Intro Section -->
    <div class="service-section">
      <p>Whether you're navigating a divorce in Dallas, a child custody issue in Houston, or a family dispute in Austin, our secure online mediation services offer a calm, structured path forward — without the emotional and financial strain of litigation.</p>
