    <!-- MSA Section -->
    <div class="service-section">
      <h2>Legally Binding Agreements (MSA Validity)</h2>
      <p>At the end of mediation, agreements are documented in a Mediation Settlement Agreement (MSA), which is:</p>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li>Legally binding and enforceable in court</li>
        <li>Clearly outlines responsibilities and terms</li>
        <li>Eligible for court approval in family law cases</li>
        <li>Designed to provide clarity and long-term stability</li>
      </ul>
      <p>This ensures your agreement is both practical and legally secure.</p>
    </div>

